# Portfolio design

The Next.js app (`app/page.js`, `app/globals.css`) is the dark blueprint (`#0B1117`, teal `#28C7D9`, Space Grotesk / IBM Plex Sans).

## Palette

- Background `#0B1117`, cards `#111A23`
- Accent `#28C7D9` for indexes, the kicker, rules, and the main button only
- Secondary accent `#4F8CFF` for timeline markers
- Text `#F5F7FA`, muted `#8B98A5`, borders `#22303C`
- Blueprint grid: 40px, teal at about 7% opacity. No neon glow, gradients, or maroon/gold

## Type and layout

- Headings: Space Grotesk. Body: IBM Plex Sans. Labels: IBM Plex Mono, uppercase
- Content width `min(1180px, calc(100% - clamp(2.2rem, 6vw, 6rem)))`, centered. The grid fills the viewport
- Nav wordmark is `Lasen.` Links: About, Education, Engineering, Skills, Activities, Contact
- Hero: name in white, “Engineering undergraduate” in teal, photo on the right with outlined `ENGINEER.` behind it
- Engineering items are technical sheets (number, title, chips, filled icon), not generic cards

## Facts

Do not invent projects, tools, awards, or dates. Keep: EEE at USJ, Ratmalana, Isipathana College Grade 1–11 with table tennis and cricket, Ananda College Grade 12 through A/Ls.
